Description: Windows Hello style face authentication for Linux
 Use your built-in IR emitters and camera in combination with face recognition
 to prove who you are. Contains the PAM module, the services, the howdy command
 and the configuration window.
 .
 The dlib models are not part of the package, download them after the
 installation with /usr/share/howdy/dlib-models/install.sh
